POST {{MovieTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/taste-profile/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 47. Personalized reccomendations (isPersonalized: true, no ids of 27205, 157336, 603)
GET {{MovieTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/recommendations/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json